Hi,

I am getting this strange error when I am trying to intall aroma.affymetrix with R 2.14 on a Linux machine.  The commands I ran were:

> source("http://aroma-project.org/hbLite.R");
> hbInstall("aroma.affymetrix");

And the error I got was:

> Updating packages: R.huge from repository 'DEFAULT'
>  01/01. R.huge: v0.3.0, i.e. up to date.
> Installing/updating: BIOC:affxparser (>= 1.22.0)
