Start a fresh R session, i.e. R --vanilla, and then see if first running

source("http://www.bioconductor.org/biocLite.R");
biocLite("affxparser");

and then

source("http://aroma-project.org/hbLite.R");
hbInstall("aroma.affymetrix");

solves it.

/Henrik

