Hi Henrik,

thanks a lot for your help. I feel sorry to have taken time from you
for such an error. This mislead me :

In http://aroma-project.org/blocks/doCRMAv2,
the usage for SNP5.0 could have been illustrated more exhaustively
with :

cdf <- AffymetrixCdfFile$byChipType("GenomeWideSNP_5",
tags="Full,r2");

csR <- AffymetrixCelSet$byName("HapMap270,testSet", cdf=cdf);
ds <- doCRMAv2(csR, verbose=-10);
instead of :
ds <- doCRMAv2("HapMap270,testSet", chipType="GenomeWideSNP_5"); ->
This yields an error because I did not properly specify the tags
(well, now I know it is because of that). I should indeed have
reported the error at this point… :-$

Anyway finally it works, thank you!

Best,

Maxime

