I've now added

ds <- doCRMAv2("HapMap270,testSet", chipType="GenomeWideSNP_5,Full,r2");

to the list of examples.  That was not possible in earlier versions
and one had to go about by setting up a 'cdf' etc.

Cheers,

Henrik

