> [2012-02-13 08:44:41] Exception: Pathname not found: rawData/C11/GenomeWideSNP_6 (rawData/C11/ exists, but nothing beyond; current directory is '/home/angelina/Documents')

So, this error says that you have the directory

/home/angelina/Documents/rawData/C11/

but not

/home/angelina/Documents/rawData/C11/GenomeWideSNP_6/

Your CEL files needs to be in the latter (and nowhere else).  You'd
find subpages 'Location of raw data files' and 'Quick Summary Of
Required File Structure' on http://www.aroma-project.org/setup/ to be
useful.

/Henrik

